)ATTR DEFAULT(@}_)
 @ TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(WHITE)
 } TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(GREEN)
 { TYPE(TEXT)   INTENS(LOW)  COLOR(TURQ)
 _ TYPE(INPUT)  INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(RED)    CAPS(ON) JUST(LEFT)
 ! TYPE(OUTPUT) INTENS(HIGH) COLOR(YELLOW) CAPS(OFF) JUST(LEFT)
)BODY
@HELP: Messages -- I to J                       !ISFHMSG                      }
@COMMAND INPUT ===>_ISFHCMD                                                   }
@INVALID DESTINATION NAME
}    DEST, or a destination typed over DEST, is not LOCAL, ANYLOCAL, Rn,
}    RMn, RMTn or Un.
@INVALID HEX STRING
}    X'..' in FIND holds something other than 0 to 9 and A to F, or an odd
}    number of digits.
@INVALID LEFT BOUNDARY, INVALID RIGHT BOUNDARY
}    A column of FIND is not a number of the data's columns.
@INVALID OPTION
}    Help: what was typed is not a topic of this panel, nor T, I or HELP.
@INVALID SCROLL AMOUNT
}    The SCROLL field, or the word before a scroll key, is not PAGE, HALF,
}    DATA, CSR, MAX or a number.
@INVALID SYNTAX
}    FIND or a setting that cannot be read (PREFIX x or y longer than one
}    character, ACTION ? with more), or a printer's SFORM, SFCB or SEP.
@JES2 NOT READABLE
}    SDSF could not read the JES2 queues.
@JOB NOT FOUND
}    The job has left the queues since the list was read, or the row has
}    no JES2 job, as an idle initiator. Enter reads the list again.
}  Enter: next page   PF7: contents   PF3: back to SDSF
)PROC
  &ISFHPFK = .PFKEY
  &ZCONT = ISFHMS4
  &ZUP = ISFHTOC
)END
